{"seq":2,"slug":"job-cancel-timeout","title":"任务取消、超时与重试边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/quota-governance/job-cancel-timeout","wordCount":2649,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务取消-超时与重试边界\">任务取消、超时与重试边界</h1><p>一个任务开始执行后，有三种方式停下来：用户主动取消、平台因超过时限强制终止、或者 worker 故障导致执行中断。这三者的触发者不同、数据收尾方式不同、且<strong>对调用方的语义完全不同</strong>。把它们混成一个「已停止」状态是最常见的建模错误——调用方需要知道是「我不要了」还是「平台失败了」，因为两者的后续动作截然相反：前者不该重提，后者应当重提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三种退出语义的核心差异在于<strong>是否保留已产生的副作用</strong>以及<strong>是否可重提</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退出方式</th>\n<th>触发者</th>\n<th>已处理的行</th>\n<th>终态</th>\n<th>可重提</th>\n<th>是否计费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>取消（用户主动）</td>\n<td>调用方</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td><code>CANCELED</code></td>\n<td>通常否</td>\n<td>按已处理量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时（超过 deadline）</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td><code>TIMED_OUT</code></td>\n<td>是（缩小规模）</td>\n<td>按已处理量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租约过期（故障恢复）</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>保留并续跑</td>\n<td>非终态</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>按实际</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「保留」是三者共同的选择。回滚已处理的行在批量场景下几乎不可行——如果任务已经调用了外部物流 API 下单，回滚意味着再调一次取消接口，而取消本身可能失败。因此批量任务的退出语义统一定义为「停止推进，保留已生效的部分」，并由调用方根据结果文件处理善后。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  PENDING --&gt; CANCELED: 用户取消&#10;  PENDING --&gt; EXPIRED: 超过 deadline 未启动&#10;  RUNNING --&gt; CANCELED: 用户取消, 保留已处理&#10;  RUNNING --&gt; TIMED_OUT: 超过 deadline&#10;  RUNNING --&gt; CANCELING: 取消请求, 等待分片收尾&#10;  CANCELING --&gt; CANCELED: 所有活跃分片已收尾\">stateDiagram-v2\n  PENDING --&gt; CANCELED: 用户取消\n  PENDING --&gt; EXPIRED: 超过 deadline 未启动\n  RUNNING --&gt; CANCELED: 用户取消, 保留已处理\n  RUNNING --&gt; TIMED_OUT: 超过 deadline\n  RUNNING --&gt; CANCELING: 取消请求, 等待分片收尾\n  CANCELING --&gt; CANCELED: 所有活跃分片已收尾</pre><p>注意 <code>CANCELING</code> 这个中间态。取消不是一个瞬间动作——worker 正在处理一批行，硬中断会导致这一批的状态不一致。<code>CANCELING</code> 表示「已收到取消请求，正在等待活跃分片自然收尾」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取消的实现\">取消的实现</h2><h3 id=\"协作式取消\">协作式取消</h3><p>取消必须由 worker <strong>主动检查</strong>并停止，而不是由外部强杀进程。理由有三：强杀会让进程内的批处理处于未知状态；强杀无法执行资源释放（数据库连接、临时文件、外部调用的收尾）；强杀无法把「已处理到哪一行」写回，导致重提时从分片起点重来。</p>\n<p>协作式取消的做法是：取消接口只更新任务状态与一个取消标志，worker 在处理每一批之前检查该标志（或检查自己分片的状态是否已被改为 <code>CANCELED</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 取消接口: 只改任务状态, 不直接动分片&#10;UPDATE bulk_jobs&#10;   SET status = CASE WHEN status = &#39;PENDING&#39; THEN &#39;CANCELED&#39; ELSE &#39;CANCELING&#39; END,&#10;       cancel_requested_at = now(),&#10;       finished_at = CASE WHEN status = &#39;PENDING&#39; THEN now() ELSE finished_at END&#10; WHERE id = $1&#10;   AND tenant_id = $2                     -- 归属校验&#10;   AND status IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;RUNNING&#39;)    -- 只有这两种状态可取消&#10;RETURNING status;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取消接口: 只改任务状态, 不直接动分片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_jobs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       cancel_requested_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       finished_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> finished_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                     -- 归属校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RUNNING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只有这两种状态可取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回 0 行表示任务已是终态或不属于该租户。两种情况都应当返回 404 或 409 而不是静默成功——调用方需要知道取消是否真的生效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"worker-侧的检查点\">worker 侧的检查点</h3><p>worker 在每个批次边界检查分片状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT status FROM bulk_job_shards WHERE id = $1 AND worker_id = $2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worker_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若返回 <code>CANCELED</code> 或空行，当前 worker 应当在<strong>完成当前批之后</strong>停止，写回已处理计数，把分片标为 <code>CANCELED</code>，然后结束。批边界检查意味着取消的响应延迟不超过一个批的处理时间（通常几百毫秒到几秒），这个粒度对用户是可接受的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不在行边界检查\">为什么不在行边界检查</h3><p>每个行边界检查意味着每处理一行就查一次数据库，开销远大于收益。批边界是自然的检查点，因为批本身是事务单位——批完成后状态是一致的，此时停止不会留下半个批。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查点粒度</th>\n<th>取消延迟</th>\n<th>额外查询开销</th>\n<th>状态一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行边界</td>\n<td>最低（≈单行耗时）</td>\n<td>每行一次，不可接受</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批边界</td>\n<td>一个批的耗时</td>\n<td>每批一次，可忽略</td>\n<td>一致（批是事务单位）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片边界</td>\n<td>一个分片的耗时</td>\n<td>每分片一次，最低</td>\n<td>一致但延迟大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅心跳时</td>\n<td>一个心跳间隔</td>\n<td>无额外开销</td>\n<td>一致，延迟最大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐批边界加心跳双重检查：批边界保证延迟粒度，心跳（见 <a href=\"../job-execution/worker-queue-rate\">Worker 队列与速率控制</a>）保证长时间不产出的分片也能被发现。</p>\n<p>若某个批异常大（例如为了减少往返而设成 10000 行），取消延迟会随之变长。这正是批大小需要与取消响应时间一起考虑的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取消的收敛\">取消的收敛</h3><p>当所有活跃分片都收尾后，任务从 <code>CANCELING</code> 转为 <code>CANCELED</code>。这个收敛与正常的任务终结是同一套机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE bulk_jobs&#10;   SET status = &#39;CANCELED&#39;, finished_at = now()&#10; WHERE id = $1&#10;   AND status = &#39;CANCELING&#39;&#10;   AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;     SELECT 1 FROM bulk_job_shards&#10;      WHERE job_id = $1 AND status NOT IN (&#39;SUCCEEDED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;CANCELED&#39;)&#10;   )&#10;RETURNING id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_jobs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, finished_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> job_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUCCEEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>CANCELED</code> 任务的计数区仍然有意义：<code>processed_count</code> 是取消前已处理的行数，<code>succeeded_count</code> 是已经真正生效的行数。调用方据此知道任务实际影响了多少业务对象——这个信息在「取消后要不要善后」的决策中是必需的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时的实现\">超时的实现</h2><h3 id=\"deadline-的两层含义\">deadline 的两层含义</h3><p>任务记录上有两个时间字段（见 <a href=\"../async-job-model/job-schema-lifecycle\">任务 schema 与生命周期状态机</a>）：<code>deadline_at</code> 约束执行，<code>expires_at</code> 约束结果保留。超时只与 <code>deadline_at</code> 有关。</p>\n<p><code>deadline_at</code> 应当在<strong>提交时</strong>确定，取值来自该操作类型的最大允许时长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{deadline} = T_{submit} + \\min(T_{type\\_max},\\ \\lambda \\cdot \\hat{T}_{estimate})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_{estimate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是提交时基于 <code>total_count</code> 与历史单行成本估算的耗时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个宽松倍数（例如 3–5），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{type\\_max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该操作类型的硬上限（例如批量导入 24 小时，对应 Shopify 文档中批量变更是「必须在 24 小时内完成，之后会被停止并标记为失败」（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/bulk-operations/imports\">Shopify Bulk Operations imports</a>））。</p>\n<p>在提交时固定而非动态延长，是为了让调用方有确定性：一旦提交，它就知道最晚什么时候会有结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超时的执行\">超时的执行</h3><p>超时由独立的看门狗执行，扫描超过 <code>deadline_at</code> 的非终态任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE bulk_jobs&#10;   SET status = &#39;TIMED_OUT&#39;,&#10;       finished_at = now(),&#10;       error_code = &#39;DEADLINE_EXCEEDED&#39;&#10; WHERE status IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;RUNNING&#39;)&#10;   AND deadline_at &lt; now()&#10;RETURNING id, job_no;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_jobs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TIMED_OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       finished_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       error_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEADLINE_EXCEEDED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RUNNING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadline_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING id, job_no;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>任务状态改为 <code>TIMED_OUT</code> 后，其活跃分片需要被停止。做法是同时把这些分片的状态改为 <code>CANCELED</code>（或一个专门的 <code>ABORTED</code>），worker 在批边界检查时自然停止。</p>\n<p>这与 Kubernetes Job 的 <code>activeDeadlineSeconds</code> 语义一致：文档说明该字段是「整个 Job 可以处于活动状态的最长时间」，超过时「所有活跃的 Pod 都被终止，Job 以 <code>DeadlineExceeded</code> 原因失败」（<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/controllers/job/\">Kubernetes Job</a>）。平台侧的对应物是「终止所有活跃分片 + 任务标记为超时」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超时与取消的语义差异\">超时与取消的语义差异</h3><p>两者都是「停止推进，保留已处理」，但对外含义不同：<code>CANCELED</code> 表示调用方主动放弃，平台不应暗示重试；<code>TIMED_OUT</code> 表示平台未能完成任务，文档应当明确指引调用方「缩小任务规模后重提」。这个指引很重要——如果调用方把超时的任务原样重提，它会在同样的地方再次超时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试边界的确定\">重试边界的确定</h2><h3 id=\"三层重试必须分开\">三层重试必须分开</h3><p>批量任务平台上有三层重试，混在一起会导致不可控的放大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>重试对象</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>上限来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行级</td>\n<td>单行的业务写入</td>\n<td>可重试的业务错误</td>\n<td>通常不重试，直接记失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片级</td>\n<td>整个分片</td>\n<td>租约过期、worker 崩溃</td>\n<td><code>attempt_count</code> 上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务级</td>\n<td>整个任务</td>\n<td>调用方显式重提</td>\n<td>配额与人工判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层重试的<strong>放大倍数</strong>依次递增：行级重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍；分片级每次重试会重跑该分片全部行，若分片有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 行则放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 倍；任务级重提放大整个任务。所以控制点应当在最内层——把不该重试的错误在行级就终结掉，避免它上升到分片级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  L1[行级: 单行业务写入] --&gt;|可重试错误| L2[分片级: 整个分片]&#10;  L1 --&gt;|不可重试| T1[记失败明细, 终结]&#10;  L1 --&gt;|限流类| B[退避后重试该行]&#10;  L2 --&gt;|attempt &lt; 5| L2&#10;  L2 --&gt;|attempt &gt;= 5| T2[分片 FAILED]&#10;  T2 --&gt; L3[任务级: 由结果表判定终态]&#10;  L3 --&gt;|调用方决定| R[用失败明细作输入重提]\">graph TD\n  L1[行级: 单行业务写入] --&gt;|可重试错误| L2[分片级: 整个分片]\n  L1 --&gt;|不可重试| T1[记失败明细, 终结]\n  L1 --&gt;|限流类| B[退避后重试该行]\n  L2 --&gt;|attempt &lt; 5| L2\n  L2 --&gt;|attempt &gt;= 5| T2[分片 FAILED]\n  T2 --&gt; L3[任务级: 由结果表判定终态]\n  L3 --&gt;|调用方决定| R[用失败明细作输入重提]</pre><p>行级<strong>不应</strong>自动重试业务错误。原因是一行的业务失败通常是数据问题（商品已下架、价格非法），重试不会改变结果，只会浪费时间。可重试的例外是限流类错误（<code>RATE_LIMITED</code>），这类错误应当由<strong>分片级的退避重试</strong>吸收，而不是行级循环。</p>\n<p>分片级重试是故障恢复的主要机制，上限用 <code>attempt_count &lt; 5</code> 这类硬条件控制（见 <a href=\"../job-execution/worker-queue-rate\">Worker 队列与速率控制</a>）。达到上限的分片应当进入终态 <code>FAILED</code> 并把错误写入 <code>last_error</code>，而不是无限重试。</p>\n<p>任务级重试不是平台的功能，是调用方的选择。平台能做的是提供「重提失败行」的便捷方式——把失败明细文件作为新任务的输入。这是批量发货这类场景最常见的操作流程：第一次跑完，人工修正失败行，用错误文件重提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重试的放大防护\">重试的放大防护</h3><p>分片级重试有一个隐蔽的放大效应：一个分片重试时会重新处理该分片的所有行。如果分片内有不可重试的失败行，每次重试都会重新遇到它们并重新记一次失败——如果结果表用的是追加而非 upsert，计数会膨胀。</p>\n<p>防护手段就是前面章节讲的行级幂等：结果表用 <code>(job_id, row_key)</code> 作主键并 <code>ON CONFLICT</code> 更新，重试时失败行只是被改写而不是新增（见 <a href=\"../job-execution/row-idempotent-partial\">行级幂等与部分成功</a>）。计数由结果表反算而非执行过程累加，因此重试不会造成计数膨胀。</p>\n<p>另一个放大点是重试导致的<strong>下游调用量翻倍</strong>。对一个分片重试 N 次，下游可能收到 N 倍调用。这也是行级幂等必须「先占坑再执行」的原因——已成功的行在重试时被占坑检查拦住，不会重复触发下游调用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种退出语义（取消、超时、租约过期）必须区分，因为调用方的后续动作相反：取消不该重提，超时应当缩小规模重提。</li>\n<li>三者共同选择是「停止推进、保留已生效的部分」；回滚在批量场景下几乎不可行。</li>\n<li>取消是协作式的：接口只改状态与标志，worker 在<strong>批边界</strong>检查并自然收尾；不能强杀进程。</li>\n<li><code>CANCELING</code> 是必要中间态，表示已收到取消请求、等待活跃分片收尾；收敛逻辑与正常终结共用一套 <code>NOT EXISTS</code> 判定。</li>\n<li><code>CANCELED</code> 任务的计数区仍有意义，调用方据此决定是否需要善后。</li>\n<li><code>deadline_at</code> 在提交时固定，取值来自操作类型上限与估算耗时的较小值；固定而非动态延长，给调用方确定性。</li>\n<li>超时由独立看门狗扫描并批量标记；语义与 Kubernetes Job 的 <code>activeDeadlineSeconds</code> 一致。</li>\n<li>三层重试必须分开：行级不重试业务错误（限流类由分片级退避吸收）；分片级用 <code>attempt_count</code> 硬上限；任务级由调用方决定。</li>\n<li>重试的两个放大点（计数膨胀、下游调用翻倍）都由行级幂等的「先占坑再执行」吸收。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务的停止机制定义了边界，但一个平台还需要能被观测和审计——见 <a href=\"bulk-job-audit-metric\">批量任务审计与运营指标</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务取消、超时与重试边界","id":"任务取消-超时与重试边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"取消的实现","id":"取消的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"协作式取消","id":"协作式取消"},{"level":3,"text":"worker 侧的检查点","id":"worker-侧的检查点"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不在行边界检查","id":"为什么不在行边界检查"},{"level":3,"text":"取消的收敛","id":"取消的收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"超时的实现","id":"超时的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"deadline 的两层含义","id":"deadline-的两层含义"},{"level":3,"text":"超时的执行","id":"超时的执行"},{"level":3,"text":"超时与取消的语义差异","id":"超时与取消的语义差异"},{"level":2,"text":"重试边界的确定","id":"重试边界的确定"},{"level":3,"text":"三层重试必须分开","id":"三层重试必须分开"},{"level":3,"text":"重试的放大防护","id":"重试的放大防护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批量配额与并发上限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/quota-governance/bulk-quota-concurrency-limit"},"next":{"title":"批量任务审计与运营指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/quota-governance/bulk-job-audit-metric"}}